description {
This is the 2024 style by Hans Straßgütl for the Enduro maps
 The style is a significant revision of the original style.
 The main changes can be found in
 * Routing / Lines: Are now set up in such a way that a finer distinction
	distinction can be made between
		- road
		- Gravel (with car)
		- Gravel easy with Enduro
		- Grass / earth strenuous with Enduro
		- Not passable
 * Polygons
	Are now clearly structured and no longer work on "chance"
}